title: Proposition 104
---
order: 104
---
short_label: X.104
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: A straight line commensurable with an apotome of a medial straight line is an apotome of a medial straight line and the same in order.
----
proof:

Let *AB* be an apotome of a medial straight line, and let *CD* be commensurable in length with *AB*.

I say that *CD* is also an apotome of a medial straight line and the same in order with *AB*.

Since *AB* is an apotome of a medial straight line, let *EB* be the annex to it.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="260" height="100" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.104 diagram" src="propX104.gif"/></noscript>
